a little bit of more time,

00:23:11.486 --> 00:23:14.170
it's a vast country,
extremely diverse.

00:23:14.171 --> 00:23:17.380
Every 20 kilometers you
go, the language changes.

00:23:17.381 --> 00:23:20.675
So, it has a lot
of thing into it,

00:23:20.676 --> 00:23:24.090
but in Spain, they
have a opt-out system.

00:23:24.091 --> 00:23:25.310
Somebody taking birth in

00:23:25.311 --> 00:23:28.440
Spain is already
considered to be in,

00:23:28.441 --> 00:23:30.664
unless and until at the deathbed,

00:23:30.665 --> 00:23:32.515
the nearer kin say,

00:23:32.516 --> 00:23:35.880
that no, I opt-out.

00:23:35.881 --> 00:23:40.960
&gt;&gt; No, I was most asking
because you said people do not,

00:23:40.961 --> 00:23:42.640
I'm not sure whether to declare

00:23:42.641 --> 00:23:45.240
