or not, the doctors.

00:23:45.241 --> 00:23:48.070
So, that sounds weird to me

00:23:48.071 --> 00:23:49.700
because there should
be a protocol and

00:23:49.701 --> 00:23:51.495
people should be just
following that protocol.

00:23:51.496 --> 00:23:53.020
&gt;&gt; Sir, there is already a law.

00:23:53.021 --> 00:23:55.480
Every hospital at
the end of the month

00:23:55.481 --> 00:23:56.680
should report how many

00:23:56.681 --> 00:23:58.620
number of brain deaths
actually occurred.

00:23:58.621 --> 00:24:01.140
But, in India there is always

00:24:01.141 --> 00:24:04.285
passing away from
this rear door to that window.

00:24:04.286 --> 00:24:06.615
&gt;&gt; In India, has a state subject,

00:24:06.616 --> 00:24:07.850
it's not a sentence subject.

00:24:07.851 --> 00:24:09.550
So, that is why
different states out

00:24:09.551 --> 00:24:11.470
of the 30 plus states only

00:24:11.471 --> 00:24:12.595
12 states right now

00:24:12.596 --> 00:24:15.430
enrolled into the brain
[inaudible] donation program.

00:24:15.431 --> 00:24:17.230
So, we're actually
taking about increasing

00:24:17.231 --> 00:24:18.700
the donation rate in those states

00:24:18.701 --> 00:24:22.165
