declaration unit.

00:24:27.211 --> 00:24:29.780
So, that is how
the whole hospital,

00:24:29.781 --> 00:24:31.480
as a whole, is
actually trying to get

00:24:31.481 --> 00:24:33.845
this cause moving forward
compared to India.

00:24:33.846 --> 00:24:37.480
&gt;&gt; We have this model in
PGIMER Chandigarh, all of this.

00:24:37.481 --> 00:24:40.030
&gt;&gt; So, thank you very much guys.

